  "id": "polysubstance-dependence",
  "term": "polysubstance dependence",
  "definition": "Polysubstance dependence refers to a history of dependence involving more than one type or class of drug, rather than dependence on a single substance alone. In this source, it is used to distinguish people with multiple-substance dependence from those with only heroin dependence, only amphetamine dependence, or no substance dependence history.",
